WEBVTT

00:35.535 --> 00:37.537
‎I'll focus on hosing down their firewalls.

00:38.204 --> 00:40.498
‎Leaving you to handle the boots.

00:41.583 --> 00:42.584
‎Got it.

00:44.878 --> 00:47.756
‎Appreciate you takin' this, Meshuga.

00:48.298 --> 00:51.468
‎Most old buggers like us
‎flamed out a good while back.

00:51.551 --> 00:54.387
‎It's just good to see ya back in the game.

02:33.486 --> 02:34.529
‎Hey, D.

02:39.576 --> 02:40.994
‎Whaddaya wanna do today?

02:48.293 --> 02:49.377
‎Roman?

02:50.920 --> 02:52.589
‎Uh... yes?

02:53.298 --> 02:54.299
‎Are you Kyoko?

02:55.258 --> 02:56.885
‎...Uh, yeah. I'm Kyoko.

02:57.468 --> 03:01.097
‎Come on, we should go.
‎Time isn't on our side.

03:08.813 --> 03:11.858
‎D? Wake up, D.

03:12.483 --> 03:13.484
‎D?

03:13.568 --> 03:14.736
‎D!

03:16.529 --> 03:17.614
‎It's just you...

03:19.324 --> 03:22.035
‎My name's Kyoko. Big fan of your work.

03:26.039 --> 03:28.958
‎Roman's told me
‎you're having trouble sleeping.

03:29.542 --> 03:35.089
‎That you struggle with nightmares.
‎Thought I could be of some help to you.

03:37.342 --> 03:40.637
‎She really knows this stuff.
‎Just hear her out.

03:41.638 --> 03:42.639
‎Don't need help.

03:44.015 --> 03:45.016
‎You know where the door is.

03:45.099 --> 03:48.394
‎I won't keep you very long,
‎all I'm asking for is a minute.

03:49.604 --> 03:52.732
‎Yupi! Hey, Yupi!
‎Stop lettin' strangers in!

03:53.274 --> 03:55.902
‎Yupi's outside. We passed her out front.

03:56.527 --> 04:00.281
‎Goddamn it... Just leave,
‎all right? Both of you.

04:00.365 --> 04:02.367
‎-But...
‎-I said go!

04:05.703 --> 04:08.998
‎Hey! Do you ever see someone
‎who shouldn't be there?

04:09.082 --> 04:12.293
‎Or hear a girl's voice?
‎Like an echo inside your head?

04:12.377 --> 04:15.171
‎-Wait, Kyoko!
‎-Is she here right now?!

04:16.631 --> 04:18.299
‎Are you outta your mind?

04:19.467 --> 04:21.552
‎Why's your face... so familiar?

04:22.971 --> 04:25.306
‎From the list!
‎That's why you're compatible!

04:26.432 --> 04:27.642
‎What list?

04:29.477 --> 04:30.728
‎Who the hell are you?

04:31.437 --> 04:32.981
‎Uh... I...

05:00.174 --> 05:01.384
‎Fuck!

05:11.811 --> 05:12.812
‎D!

05:23.448 --> 05:25.533
‎Hey! Did you see a small woman?

05:26.701 --> 05:28.828
‎A small woman! She ran this way!

05:28.911 --> 05:32.332
‎I was just passin' through...
‎How about you chooms?

05:32.415 --> 05:34.208
‎You hidin' her?

05:39.422 --> 05:40.798
‎D!

05:45.053 --> 05:47.722
‎Well, shit. Guess he didn't see her...

05:47.805 --> 05:49.223
‎Did you?

05:49.307 --> 05:52.518
‎You've gotta stop! Get outta here now!

05:59.108 --> 06:00.568
‎Who was that bitch?

06:00.651 --> 06:03.529
‎I dunno, honest! I only just met her!

06:04.072 --> 06:07.158
‎Said she watches our videos.
‎Knows a lot about cyberware and stuff...

06:07.241 --> 06:09.869
‎-Then why was she here?
‎-Because you've been acting insane!

06:11.871 --> 06:14.040
‎I'm worried about you, D!

06:14.624 --> 06:16.584
‎Haven't been yourself lately!

06:17.752 --> 06:20.296
‎You just attacked a total stranger.

06:20.379 --> 06:22.048
‎And Kyoko, too.

06:22.131 --> 06:25.885
‎She said you might be
‎goin' cyberpsycho, so I thought...

06:27.178 --> 06:28.554
‎Cyberpsychosis?

06:29.222 --> 06:30.681
‎Is that why you brought her?

06:32.141 --> 06:33.434
‎Wait!

06:33.518 --> 06:36.562
‎She knew about the raid...

06:36.646 --> 06:38.815
‎And about the Arasaka file
‎with my name on it.

06:39.398 --> 06:40.691
‎She knows why I'm on it.

06:41.400 --> 06:44.112
‎-Are you sure?
‎-Capri showed me all the dirt.

06:44.195 --> 06:45.196
‎Capri did?

06:45.279 --> 06:47.323
‎Still doesn't mean
‎you can just ‎kill‎ people.

06:47.406 --> 06:51.577
‎Cut the shit! You dragged her here
‎without knowing anything about her!

06:53.788 --> 06:55.748
‎She wants to take Capri.

06:55.832 --> 06:57.041
‎I know she does.

06:59.669 --> 07:00.962
‎Is she really that important?

07:01.045 --> 07:03.089
‎The fuck am I gonna do without Capri?

07:05.675 --> 07:08.094
‎Look at what you're doin' with her power!

07:08.177 --> 07:10.221
‎-Getting revenge!
‎-You're wrong!

07:10.304 --> 07:12.181
‎This is murder!

07:12.265 --> 07:13.891
‎Murder is just murder, D!

07:14.600 --> 07:16.811
‎I'm doing this for my family.

07:16.894 --> 07:18.521
‎You wouldn't understand.

07:18.604 --> 07:20.106
‎No, you're doing this for you!

07:20.773 --> 07:22.733
‎You say it's for the dead,
‎but that's a lie!

07:25.278 --> 07:26.487
‎A lie?

07:30.032 --> 07:32.493
‎Like I said...
‎There's no way you'd understand.

07:33.703 --> 07:34.912
‎You're not like me.

07:36.038 --> 07:37.290
‎What do you mean?

07:37.373 --> 07:38.875
‎They're still here, Roman.

07:39.584 --> 07:41.461
‎They never leave. Never.

07:42.211 --> 07:43.379
‎It can't be a lie!

07:44.130 --> 07:45.131
‎D...

07:46.007 --> 07:48.259
‎But I'd be a liar if I gave up now.

07:55.349 --> 07:56.517
‎Get lost.

07:57.226 --> 07:58.644
‎And don't find your way back.

08:13.034 --> 08:14.035
‎D.

08:15.119 --> 08:16.412
‎We got a bite!

08:27.048 --> 08:28.090
‎Who did you say?

08:28.174 --> 08:30.927
‎Claims to be a researcher at Arasaka.

08:31.010 --> 08:33.888
‎She's asking whether the Capricorn project
‎is of interest to us.

08:34.889 --> 08:36.057
‎What?

08:48.319 --> 08:49.320
‎Mom?

08:50.488 --> 08:51.948
‎How long you been here?

08:52.031 --> 08:53.449
‎Not all that long.

08:53.533 --> 08:54.742
‎Really?

08:54.825 --> 08:56.327
‎You shoulda woke me up.

08:58.704 --> 08:59.705
‎What?

09:04.252 --> 09:05.795
‎What is it?

09:05.878 --> 09:06.879
‎Stay still for me.

09:13.719 --> 09:14.720
‎What's wrong?

09:15.721 --> 09:18.099
‎No matter what happens...

09:19.559 --> 09:21.435
‎Your mama will always love you.

09:25.815 --> 09:27.108
‎Mom...

09:28.985 --> 09:31.529
‎I haven't given up yet.

09:33.030 --> 09:34.031
‎Yeah.

09:57.888 --> 09:59.515
‎Let's get one thing straight.

10:00.099 --> 10:02.059
‎I'm prepared
‎to tell you everything I know.

10:02.143 --> 10:05.855
‎But only with your assurance
‎I leave here unharmed.

10:06.522 --> 10:07.607
‎Seems fair.

10:07.690 --> 10:09.025
‎Uh-huh.

10:09.817 --> 10:12.653
‎A "research expedition"
‎was sent to your camp.

10:12.737 --> 10:15.698
‎The R&D department sought
‎candidates for their research.

10:15.781 --> 10:20.036
‎Provided they met the criteria.

10:21.704 --> 10:23.080
‎Criteria?

10:23.164 --> 10:28.336
‎High empathy, strong implant tolerance...
‎A few boxes they needed checked.

10:28.419 --> 10:29.879
‎What kinda research?

10:29.962 --> 10:32.048
‎Weapons development.

10:33.049 --> 10:36.636
‎Their ideal candidates differed
‎from project to project.

10:37.178 --> 10:40.890
‎And the labs lacked the means
‎to find them on their own.

10:41.766 --> 10:44.602
‎Hence the need
‎for Counterintel to step in.

10:44.685 --> 10:47.521
‎So you're sayin' someone
‎in D's clan matched the bill?

10:47.605 --> 10:48.814
‎Your man himself.

10:49.774 --> 10:50.775
‎Me?

10:51.317 --> 10:55.071
‎That so-called "research expedition"
‎was an extraction to secure you.

10:55.821 --> 11:00.493
‎Wanting to keep our books clean, we hired
‎a fixer to arrange it. That was a mistake.

11:01.285 --> 11:03.996
‎Of all mercs, they subcontracted
‎the work to Maelstrom.

11:04.872 --> 11:06.540
‎Those chromecrunchers could botch a job

11:06.624 --> 11:08.834
‎even if you handed it
‎to them gift-wrapped.

11:09.585 --> 11:12.088
‎A minor scuffle snowballed
‎into a slaughter.

11:13.130 --> 11:15.257
‎Didn't know until later
‎you weren't even there.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.093
‎Hold on.

11:17.176 --> 11:21.347
‎You're saying I lost everyone
‎because you were looking for me?

11:21.430 --> 11:23.140
‎Not us.

11:23.224 --> 11:26.143
‎The company. Don't get it twisted.

11:26.227 --> 11:28.229
‎So who gave the order?

11:28.312 --> 11:31.148
‎-An exec named Tanaka.
‎-Then let's go kill that jerk!

11:31.232 --> 11:34.527
‎Is it true? Kenzo, Renée...

11:34.610 --> 11:36.028
‎-D?
‎-Everyone's dead...

11:36.112 --> 11:38.364
‎-You're too late.
‎-Huh? Whaddaya mean?

11:38.447 --> 11:41.742
‎-Tanaka's already dead. He was killed.
‎-It's all my fault?

11:41.826 --> 11:43.077
‎Killed?

11:43.160 --> 11:47.581
‎Abducted and tortured
‎by some mercs. Fried his brain.

11:47.665 --> 11:51.001
‎Leader of their crew, Maine,
‎didn't survive the ordeal either.

11:52.461 --> 11:55.131
‎What? Everyone's already dead?

11:55.214 --> 11:57.174
‎How totally convenient.

11:57.258 --> 11:58.342
‎It's the truth.

11:59.093 --> 12:01.303
‎Name David Martinez ring a bell?

12:01.387 --> 12:02.847
‎Like, obviously...

12:03.889 --> 12:06.517
‎Wait, wasn't Maine the guy that...

12:06.600 --> 12:11.105
‎Yes. He was there, too,
‎when they killed Tanaka.

12:11.188 --> 12:13.566
‎That may not have been a coincidence.

12:13.649 --> 12:14.650
‎Whaddaya mean by that?

12:14.733 --> 12:16.610
‎Martinez was on the same list.

12:17.361 --> 12:20.322
‎The stunt he pulled later
‎may be related somehow.

12:20.990 --> 12:23.367
‎Punk brat nearly killed me too.

12:23.451 --> 12:25.369
‎Thought that shitstorm
‎had finally died out.

12:25.453 --> 12:28.539
‎Then you showed up hungry for blood.

12:28.622 --> 12:31.417
‎What you did to Jake
‎had me on edge, I'll admit.

12:32.418 --> 12:33.961
‎Ready to wash my hands of this.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.672
‎-What about me?
‎-Hmm?

12:37.798 --> 12:39.800
‎What am I supposed to do now?

12:39.884 --> 12:41.427
‎Do about what?

12:41.510 --> 12:44.221
‎They're all dead because of me.

12:45.222 --> 12:47.224
‎And the whole thing was my fault...

12:48.100 --> 12:49.310
‎What do I do?

12:49.935 --> 12:52.813
‎I don't know. But if they're dead,
‎that means... it's over.

12:52.897 --> 12:54.940
‎You have your revenge.

12:56.066 --> 12:58.235
‎Now, I've told you all I can.

12:58.319 --> 13:00.070
‎I trust you'll keep your word.

13:03.157 --> 13:04.575
‎It's not over.

13:05.618 --> 13:07.119
‎It's far from over.

13:09.663 --> 13:11.081
‎What are you--

13:22.968 --> 13:28.057
‎That's right, D!
‎Who cares who gave the orders?

13:28.140 --> 13:31.852
‎They're all the same.
‎Burn Arasaka to the fucking ground!

13:44.907 --> 13:47.034
‎-Do it!
‎-Finish 'em!

14:01.674 --> 14:04.134
‎Burn, Night City, burn!

14:06.720 --> 14:08.764
‎Fuckin' gonks!

14:08.847 --> 14:10.140
‎The hell are you thinkin'?

14:13.269 --> 14:14.395
‎-Fuck you, pigs!
‎-C'mon!

14:14.478 --> 14:16.564
‎See you in hell!

14:22.903 --> 14:24.321
‎Crank up the heat!

14:24.405 --> 14:26.282
‎You crazy bastards...

15:03.527 --> 15:06.864
‎If that'll be all,
‎another matter requires my attention.

15:15.122 --> 15:17.541
‎Meshuga. In position.

15:17.625 --> 15:20.628
‎Yeah, read you on ping. All set on my end.

15:20.711 --> 15:23.172
‎I'll open sesame the back door
‎when you give it a knock.

15:23.797 --> 15:25.132
‎Gimme one sec.

15:25.633 --> 15:28.594
‎Avida, I want you to stay here.

15:28.677 --> 15:31.055
‎Why? I'm going with you.

15:31.138 --> 15:33.807
‎It ain't smart. Too much can go wrong.

15:33.891 --> 15:37.353
‎We're here to choose Talia's new body.
‎I have to be the one to see it and decide.

15:38.771 --> 15:41.857
‎King, sorry to butt in.
‎Somethin' you might wanna hear...

15:41.941 --> 15:43.150
‎We have a problem?

15:43.233 --> 15:44.735
‎Opposite, actually.

15:44.818 --> 15:47.655
‎Got word there's a riot headed
‎for City Center.

15:47.738 --> 15:50.908
‎Corp security's being pulled to support.

15:50.991 --> 15:53.661
‎I'd say odds are the lab's
‎gonna be pretty short-staffed.

15:53.744 --> 15:54.745
‎That's confirmed?

15:54.828 --> 15:57.748
‎Blastin' all over the news, yeah.

15:57.831 --> 15:59.792
‎That, and a drizzle in the forecast.

16:00.751 --> 16:01.794
‎What's goin' on?

16:04.588 --> 16:07.383
‎Fine. We go together.

16:07.466 --> 16:09.718
‎Hey, Hank, when we make our exit,

16:09.802 --> 16:12.012
‎-whip the van to the back door.
‎-You got it.

16:23.524 --> 16:26.026
‎There he is. Now's our chance.

16:34.284 --> 16:37.830
‎The riots that erupted
‎in Wellsprings earlier today

16:37.913 --> 16:40.332
‎have led to violent clashes with the NCPD...

16:47.715 --> 16:50.801
‎David! David!

16:53.887 --> 16:55.973
‎David! Stop!

16:56.056 --> 16:58.809
‎You again? You're not wanted here.

16:58.892 --> 17:00.436
‎Fucking likewise!

17:07.151 --> 17:11.447
‎The hell are you doing? You're not
‎seriously going up against Arasaka?

17:11.530 --> 17:14.033
‎They'll kill you!

17:19.038 --> 17:20.831
‎David!

17:28.922 --> 17:30.674
‎Oh, my God, D!

17:31.925 --> 17:33.844
‎Can you believe this?

17:35.929 --> 17:37.097
‎They don't learn.

17:37.181 --> 17:39.475
‎They keep flyin' in just to get shot down.

17:41.560 --> 17:43.228
‎What does it matter?

17:55.074 --> 17:57.201
‎Uh... D?

18:01.622 --> 18:03.040
‎D!

18:04.124 --> 18:06.293
‎Get away from him!

18:06.376 --> 18:08.045
‎What is that?

18:11.381 --> 18:12.841
‎Wake up, D!

18:13.509 --> 18:15.552
‎D! C'mon!

18:30.150 --> 18:31.819
‎Well, that doesn't look good.

18:55.801 --> 18:56.802
‎Daddy...

19:09.982 --> 19:12.776
‎Who the hell do you think made that chip?

19:13.527 --> 19:16.155
‎Of course I thought to design a failsafe.

19:35.883 --> 19:37.301
‎Target secured.

19:37.926 --> 19:41.180
‎See how easy it is when you trust me?

19:41.263 --> 19:42.723
‎What about your end?

19:42.806 --> 19:44.308
‎Excellent work.

19:44.391 --> 19:46.185
‎I'll be wrapping up here shortly.

19:46.268 --> 19:48.437
‎Y'know... and I mean this as a compliment...

19:48.520 --> 19:50.898
‎You're as corpo trash as they come.

19:57.905 --> 20:00.949
‎Behind that door
‎is the access point to Soulkiller.

20:01.033 --> 20:02.201
‎And security?

20:02.284 --> 20:04.119
‎Taking longer than expected...

20:04.661 --> 20:06.955
‎Meantime, you focus on findin' a body.

20:07.039 --> 20:08.707
‎Pick one.

20:09.374 --> 20:11.627
‎We don't have time to shop around.

20:11.710 --> 20:12.711
‎I know.

20:20.385 --> 20:22.221
‎None of these are Talia...

20:22.971 --> 20:24.640
‎You still have to choose.

20:25.766 --> 20:30.395
‎Seein' my baby tear herself apart,
‎piece by piece. I couldn't bear it.

20:30.479 --> 20:33.232
‎Now she has to lose all that's left?

20:33.315 --> 20:35.734
‎She won't be my little girl anymore.

20:35.817 --> 20:38.070
‎Didn't think of that before we started?

20:38.153 --> 20:40.864
‎This is how we keep her alive,
‎don't have another choice!

20:40.948 --> 20:42.366
‎I know that.

20:42.449 --> 20:45.118
‎The Talia you know will still be in there.

20:45.744 --> 20:47.829
‎Right now,
‎all that matters is she survives!

20:47.913 --> 20:49.248
‎I said I know...

20:50.374 --> 20:51.458
‎Oi, King!

20:51.541 --> 20:53.627
‎-What now?
‎-We got a sitch.

20:54.294 --> 20:56.505
‎Riot's over, mob's dispersin'.

20:56.588 --> 20:58.131
‎Better get a damn move on.

20:58.215 --> 20:59.216
‎Understood.

20:59.967 --> 21:01.385
‎Avida, we're outta time.

21:01.468 --> 21:04.263
‎If you won't make a decision, then I will.

21:07.432 --> 21:08.642
‎I've made up my mind.

21:13.981 --> 21:15.649
‎Agh! The hell?

21:15.732 --> 21:16.900
‎What's wrong?

21:16.984 --> 21:19.653
‎No way... Fuck, fuck, fuck--

21:19.736 --> 21:21.780
‎Meshuga? Meshuga!

21:22.364 --> 21:23.532
‎Shit!

21:23.615 --> 21:25.534
‎Now Soulkiller...

21:27.744 --> 21:28.745
‎Somethin' wrong?

21:29.663 --> 21:31.081
‎Let's just get the body outside.

21:44.970 --> 21:46.388
‎Hey! Meshuga's burned!

21:47.222 --> 21:48.265
‎He'll be fine.

21:48.348 --> 21:49.933
‎Like hell he will!

21:52.394 --> 21:54.563
‎-Fuck. C'mon!
‎-Dumbass!

21:58.317 --> 21:59.735
‎Dammit!

22:01.403 --> 22:03.280
‎How'd there get here so fast?

22:05.699 --> 22:08.994
‎Him? Didn't Avida cover her tracks?

22:24.343 --> 22:26.386
‎Shit... Let's go.

22:26.470 --> 22:27.888
‎Avida!

22:48.283 --> 22:49.409
‎Should we pursue?

22:49.493 --> 22:52.329
‎No need. I've broken the man.

22:52.412 --> 22:54.414
‎He no longer poses a threat.

22:55.791 --> 22:56.792
‎Yes.

22:57.709 --> 23:00.962
‎My apologies.
‎It took longer than expected.

23:01.046 --> 23:02.464
‎I'm returning now.

23:11.765 --> 23:13.850
‎Good news. Think we lost 'em.

23:17.270 --> 23:18.563
‎You were hit?

23:23.652 --> 23:25.821
‎Shit... Where?

23:25.904 --> 23:27.072
‎Where were you hit?

23:28.490 --> 23:29.491
‎I'm sorry.

23:33.411 --> 23:36.206
‎Trauma Team should be here any minute.
‎You'll be okay!

23:38.041 --> 23:39.459
‎Weak...

23:45.257 --> 23:46.424
‎Please, Talia...

23:48.301 --> 23:49.302
‎I know.

25:49.923 --> 25:54.928
‎Subtitle translation by:
‎CD PROJEKT RED & Megumi Hunter
